WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
Don't look at the guests, but most of the people living here are civilians.

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:04,560
But in fact, most of these civilians have one thing in common:

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,840
That is, most of the men in the family are soldiers.

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,200
Just like the one opposite you

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,880
A family of seven children, old and young, lives here

6
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,120
Don't think it's easy to bully others

7
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,480
But no one dares to provoke

8
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,800
Because their men are serving as soldiers under the Marquis of Zhenyuan

9
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,720
Because we have the same family and men

10
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,720
So the people around here are very united.

11
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,440
No one has the guts to cause trouble here.

12
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,360
I also heard that even the lord of Yunqi City

13
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,640
Everyone has suffered a loss here

14
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,440
A bitch who was scolded by an old lady

15
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,680
I don’t even dare to change my mouth.

16
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:31,850
Then choose this house

17
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:35,900
Guest, you are really discerning. Sorry to bother you.

18
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,500
Please help to complete the procedures as soon as possible

19
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,540
No trouble, no trouble

20
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:41,860
I promise you can check in today and reward you

21
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,060
What you said is what it should be.

22
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,900
And if you have anything to do in Yunqicheng in the future, just come to me.

23
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:51,710
I promise to do everything right for you

24
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,640
Then you are busy and I will leave first.
